WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 13 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:09.300
Does that make you feel powerful? Taking another man's leftovers? That is not manly at all.

2
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.300
I thought you were more of a man.

3
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.300
Please! Calm down!

4
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.300
What are you doing to him?

5
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:34.700
He was assaulting my wife.

6
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.700
That's true.

7
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.700
Really? You were calling for help.

8
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.700
He spilled a drink on him, and I was cleaning his clothes.

9
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.700
And how did he end up naked?

10
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.700
He was changing his clothes — you walked in at the wrong time.

11
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.700
Timing, my friend, is everything — in surfing and in love.

12
00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.700
Can you take me home?

13
00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:02.010
You can stay here if you want.

14
00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:05.010
We all need to relax before tomorrow's show.

15
00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:06.010
Let's go.
